OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate staff member at
OL,4,Afailing school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school has been placed into special
OL,7,Fmeasures at the same time a member of
OL,8,Fstaff is investigated by the police
OL,9,Fbecause of their conduct involving a
OL,10,Fchild.
OL,12,FOfsted inspectors found safeguarding
OL,13,Ffailures at Manshead Church of England
OL,14,FAcademy, near Dunstable, Bedfordshire,
OL,15,Fnoting staff had not anticipated risks
OL,16,Fposed by "some pupils who demonstrate
OL,17,Fharmful sexual behaviour".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
