OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate staff member at
OL,4,Afailing school
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report also found that some boys
OL,7,Fshowed a lack of respect towards girls,
OL,8,Fwhile homophobic language, racist
OL,9,Fattitudes and "harmful banter" often
OL,10,Fwent unaddressed.
OL,12,FCentral Bedfordshire Council said the
OL,13,FOfsted inspection took place in July
OL,14,Fafter the authority raised concerns
OL,15,Fregarding the academy.
